                            sh:resultMessage "Protection coverage evidence is required when ice accretion is an applicable hazard.",
                                "Protection coverage evidence is required when liquid freezing or viscosity increase is an applicable hazard.",
                                "Protection coverage evidence is required when seawater ice ingestion is an applicable hazard.",
                                "Protection coverage evidence is required when seawater intake temperature is an applicable hazard.",
                                "Protection coverage evidence is required when snow accumulation is an applicable hazard.",
                                "Protection coverage evidence is required when snow ingestion is an applicable hazard." ;
                            sh:resultSeverity sh:Violation ;
